==Enemy==
Mamon schemes with a brand new arsenal to defeat the Battle Cats once and for all! He has very high coverage through [[Explosion]] that bolsters his standing range of 420 into an effective 695 range. His [[Shield]] has grown rather weak from his previous defeat, even in Emperor Warumongar's strongest appearances; with a knockback count of three, his Shield is weaker than even [[Aku Doge]]'s at 100% strength magnification, making it mostly cosmetic aside from it letting him absorb the first few hits of damage he takes (specifically from nukers). Additionally, his attack cycle is quite long, making it easy to accumulate damage over time on him. But like any good villain, this isn't [[Grand Emperor Warumongar|all he has planned]]...

==Strategy==
The best way to put Emperor Warumongar down for good is through the ultimate weapon against all Kaijins: [[Giga-Nyan Rex (Uber Rare Cat)|Giga-Nyan Prime DX]]. It outranges Mamon and is immune to his Explosions, making it an ideal counter in all of his appearances. Outside of this, you should utilize fast attackers like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and [[Scarf Cat (Special Cat)|Red Nyanko Ranger]] to deal huge bursts of damage in between each of his attacks. Other [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Rangers]] don't work nearly as well, but should still be used for their [[Cat Combo]]s if the situation demands them.

